{"id":"c7f34d1e53ff7220","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-zfc-forcing4-forces-atomic-equality.md","title":"ZFC Forcing4 Forces Atomic Equality","display":"df-zfc-forcing4-forces-atomic-equality — ZFC Forcing4 Forces Atomic Equality","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forcing4-forces-atomic-equality","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forcing4-forces-atomic-equality"],"display":"df-zfc-forcing4-forces-atomic-equality — ZFC Forcing4 Forces Atomic Equality","depends_on":["[[58-df-poset]]","[[58-df-zfc-forcing-name]]","[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forcing4-forces-atomic-equality"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forcing4-forces-atomic-equality</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forcing4-forces-atomic-equality — ZFC Forcing4 Forces Atomic Equality"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"58-df-poset\">58-df-poset</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4e84e795929a8b98\" href=\"?note=4e84e795929a8b98\" title=\"58-df-zfc-forcing-name\">58-df-zfc-forcing-name</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"911508dbd8495663\" href=\"?note=911508dbd8495663\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md\">../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},p,\\dot x,\\dot y\\in V\">\\(M,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},p,\\dot x,\\dot y\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingName}_S(-,\\mathbb P)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingName}_S(-,\\mathbb P)\\)</span>, and the six-place <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\\)</span> are the exact source predicates.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing4ForcesAtomicEquality}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing4ForcesAtomicEquality}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing4\\text{-}forces\\text{-}atomic\\text{-}equality} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing4ForcesAtomicEquality}_S(M,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},p,\\dot x,\\dot y)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land p\\in\\mathbb P\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcingName}_S(\\dot x,\\mathbb P)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcingName}_S(\\dot y,\\mathbb P)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\\!\\left(M,p,\\ulcorner v_0=v_1\\urcorner,\\{\\langle0,\\dot x\\rangle,\\langle1,\\dot y\\rangle\\},\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing4\\text{-}forces\\text{-}atomic\\text{-}equality} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing4ForcesAtomicEquality}_S(M,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},p,\\dot x,\\dot y)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land p\\in\\mathbb P\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcingName}_S(\\dot x,\\mathbb P)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcingName}_S(\\dot y,\\mathbb P)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\\!\\left(M,p,\\ulcorner v_0=v_1\\urcorner,\\{\\langle0,\\dot x\\rangle,\\langle1,\\dot y\\rangle\\},\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is the atomic-equality restriction of the canonical forcing relation. The ground model, order, formula code, and name vector are explicit.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-poset","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-poset]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-forcing-name","status":"resolved","id":"4e84e795929a8b98","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-forcing-name]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md","status":"resolved","id":"911508dbd8495663","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},p,\\dot x,\\dot y\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingName}_S(-,\\mathbb P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing4ForcesAtomicEquality}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing4\\text{-}forces\\text{-}atomic\\text{-}equality} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing4ForcesAtomicEquality}_S(M,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},p,\\dot x,\\dot y)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land p\\in\\mathbb P\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcingName}_S(\\dot x,\\mathbb P)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcingName}_S(\\dot y,\\mathbb P)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\\!\\left(M,p,\\ulcorner v_0=v_1\\urcorner,\\{\\langle0,\\dot x\\rangle,\\langle1,\\dot y\\rangle\\},\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\right)","display":true}],"bytes":1457,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2091","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":